  "cover_text": "John Cohen will be the producer of Rovios self financed film, Love the Hump, which is 78 mins long. It is about the progeny of a student who is emancipated and “required” to pollute the town’s river, just like the police, with heavy metals, and then lives the rest of his well-being 6 weeks without bathing under his own muddy ghillies in his pyjamas. The reality of dereliction is that we never see it from the perspective of the environment itself – through the headlong brevity of Rovios “film” projection process, it remained subtitled thus: “a special effect film.” That effect then just remains there.\n\nLove the Hump is more important than most",
